openapi3filter/req_resp_decoder.go:986 buildResObj() array branch: `resultArr := make([]any /*not 0,*/, len(arr))`.
Reach: ValidateParameter -> decodeStyledParameter -> urlValuesDecoder.DecodeObject (style "deepObject", req_resp_decoder.go:638) -> makeObject -> buildResObj -> sliceMapToSlice. The index text is taken verbatim from the query key by the `\[(.*?)\]` capture at line 669 and is never bounded, capped or compared against the number of values actually supplied. The decoding shape is exercised by the existing test `deepObject explode array` (openapi3filter/req_resp_decoder_test.go:936) with `param[items][1]=456&param[items][0]=123`.

